# Oracle gate working directory: the acquired third-party validator and package, the regenerated
# corpus, the validator's reports, and the published verdict. All of it is reproducible from the
# seeds in scripts/oracle/coverage-policy.json and the pin in scripts/oracle/oracle-lock.json, and
# none of it is ours to commit.
.oracle/

# Cross-engine determinism gate working directory: the per-engine digest reports one job leaves for
# the comparison job to read. Every one of them is reproducible from the seeds in
# scripts/determinism/determinism-policy.json on the engine that produced it. The BASELINE those
# reports are measured against is committed, deliberately, and lives in scripts/determinism/.
.determinism/

# Local
.cache/
.turbo/
dist-artifacts/
